			"text": " And it's not like I don't have something to fucking offer, please."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:07,520",
				"to": "00:10:13,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 607520,
				"to": 613120
			},
			"text": " I have knowledge in my head people will pay fucking tens of thousands of dollars for."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:13,120",
				"to": "00:10:24,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 613120,
				"to": 624960
			},
			"text": " Shit, hundreds of thousands of dollars for all the fucking decades of experience I got."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:24,960",
				"to": "00:10:43,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 624960,
				"to": 643360
			},
			"text": " I can't even get a fucking conversation, let alone even acknowledged that I exist."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:43,360",
				"to": "00:10:52,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 643360,
				"to": 652120
			},
			"text": " You know, you can only redesign things so many fucking times until you just give up"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:52,120",
				"to": "00:10:57,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 652120,
				"to": 657000
			},
			"text": " on shit, you know?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:57,000",
				"to": "00:11:01,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 657000,
				"to": 661160
			},
			"text": " It's like 80/20 principle, at least that comes to mind, you know?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:01,160",
				"to": "00:11:08,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 661160,
				"to": 668640
			},
			"text": " You've put in the 80%, and that last 20% really doesn't get you much else, and like, I feel"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:08,640",
				"to": "00:11:26,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 668640,
				"to": 686560
			},
			"text": " like I'm at 90% and like, you know, I'm just fucking exhausted from surviving, not living"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:26,560",
				"to": "00:11:30,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 686560,
				"to": 690800
			},
			"text": " for more than three years now."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:30,800",
				"to": "00:11:40,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 690800,
				"to": 700400
			},
			"text": " Three years without steady employment is this May, May 2023 was when my last gig ended,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:40,400",
				"to": "00:11:52,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 700400,
				"to": 712160
			},
			"text": " May 15th, 2023."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:52,160",
				"to": "00:12:00,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 712160,
				"to": 720680
			},
			"text": " And yeah, I'm at a stretch right now to find any kind of silver lining to this, you know?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:00,680",
				"to": "00:12:05,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 720680,
				"to": 725320
			},
			"text": " What the fuck else do I got?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:05,320",
				"to": "00:12:09,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 725320,
				"to": 729560
			},
			"text": " I just got to keep showing up."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:09,560",
				"to": "00:12:17,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 729560,
				"to": 737880
			},
			"text": " It seems pointless, it seems fruitless."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:17,880",
				"to": "00:12:23,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 737880,
				"to": 743600
			},
			"text": " Just seems like throwing more good effort away."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:23,600",
				"to": "00:12:29,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 743600,
				"to": 749080
			},
			"text": " You know, being exhausted after surviving all those years and now I got to fucking double"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:29,080",
				"to": "00:12:34,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 749080,
				"to": 754120
			},
			"text": " down and hustle as I have been for a couple weeks."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:34,120",
				"to": "00:12:43,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 754120,
				"to": 763680
			},
			"text": " Like I said, redoing shit, redesigning, fucking coming up with a valuable offer that is like"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:43,680",
				"to": "00:13:03,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 763680,
				"to": 783120
			},
			"text": " worth 10 times what I'm selling it for or offering it for, easily worth 10 times."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:03,120",
				"to": "00:13:28,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 783120,
				"to": 808120
			},
			"text": " So yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:28,120",
				"to": "00:13:47,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 808120,
				"to": 827320
			},
			"text": " yeah, really that's that that's kind of the whole thing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:47,320",
				"to": "00:13:55,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 827320,
				"to": 835520
			},
			"text": " In summary is you just got to keep fucking showing up because you don't have any other"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:13:55,520",
				"to": "00:14:00,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 835520,
				"to": 840020
			},
			"text": " choice."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:00,020",
				"to": "00:14:07,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 840020,
				"to": 847280
			},
			"text": " Well you do, but it's not a choice anybody wants to take."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:07,280",
				"to": "00:14:14,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 847280,
				"to": 854920
			},
			"text": " You know, it basically boils down to tapping out, which, you know, in terms of this article"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:14,920",
				"to": "00:14:18,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 854920,
				"to": 858080
			},
			"text": " and writing, I'd rather not even bring this up."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:18,080",
				"to": "00:14:21,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 858080,
				"to": 861520
			},
			"text": " I mean, I'm not that has not come into my mind."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:21,520",
				"to": "00:14:23,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 861520,
				"to": 863480
			},
			"text": " My head isn't in that space."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:23,480",
				"to": "00:14:28,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 863480,
				"to": 868800
			},
			"text": " I'm glad, you know, I'm just in this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:28,800",
				"to": "00:14:34,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 868800,
				"to": 874400
			},
			"text": " I feel like I'm in this fucking giant canyon going hello and I just hear my fucking voice"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:34,400",
				"to": "00:14:39,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 874400,
				"to": 879960
			},
			"text": " going way off into the distance and nothing ever."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:14:39,960",
				"to": "00:15:02,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 879960,
				"to": 902120
			},
			"text": " I don't fucking hear from anyone, not a fucking soul."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:15:02,120",
				"to": "00:15:12,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 902120,
				"to": 912600
			},
			"text": " You know, this is documentation of getting back on your fucking feet and it ain't pretty."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:15:12,600",
				"to": "00:15:27,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 912600,
				"to": 927120
			},
			"text": " I just had a birthday living in a room inside my family's home, you know, my family is supporting"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:15:27,120",
				"to": "00:15:45,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 927120,
				"to": 945520
			},
			"text": " me and that fucking George Washington monument high level of shame is crazy to deal with."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:15:45,520",
				"to": "00:15:55,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 945520,
				"to": 955500
			},
			"text": " The thing is, though, I've dealt with so much shame in my life and in particular over these"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:15:55,500",
				"to": "00:16:01,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 955500,
				"to": 961920
			},
			"text": " past years and processing wounds and trauma and stuff that it doesn't faze me."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:01,920",
				"to": "00:16:08,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 961920,
				"to": 968840
			},
			"text": " I actually I mean, I if I focus on it, it's there where the focus goes."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:08,840",
				"to": "00:16:09,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 968840,
				"to": 969840
			},
			"text": " The energy flows."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:09,840",
				"to": "00:16:13,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 969840,
				"to": 973140
			},
			"text": " If I focus on shame, that's what I'll be vibing with."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:13,140",
				"to": "00:16:15,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 973140,
				"to": 975160
			},
			"text": " And I'm just not going there."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:15,160",
				"to": "00:16:18,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 975160,
				"to": 978320
			},
			"text": " It's it's it's I am really surfing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:18,320",
				"to": "00:16:19,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 978320,
				"to": 979840
			},
			"text": " I'm picking my waves."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:19,840",
				"to": "00:16:24,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 979840,
				"to": 984920
			},
			"text": " You know, it used to be that, you know, life was going to say, oh, you're doing this set"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:24,920",
				"to": "00:16:26,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 984920,
				"to": 986200
			},
			"text": " of waves today."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:26,200",
				"to": "00:16:29,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 986200,
				"to": 989240
			},
			"text": " And I'm on the beach now going, I'm going to do this one."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:29,240",
				"to": "00:16:36,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 989240,
				"to": 996440
			},
			"text": " But it turns out like every set of waves I'm picking, I'm I'm riding them and I'm getting"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:36,440",
				"to": "00:16:39,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 996440,
				"to": 999360
			},
			"text": " back to shore."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:39,360",
				"to": "00:16:44,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 999360,
				"to": 1004760
			},
			"text": " But everybody else is walking home with the money and I'm getting nothing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:44,760",
				"to": "00:16:46,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1004760,
				"to": 1006060
			},
			"text": " People don't even see me."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:46,060",
				"to": "00:16:49,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1006060,
				"to": 1009800
			},
			"text": " They don't even see me surfing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:49,800",
				"to": "00:16:54,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1009800,
				"to": 1014760
			},
			"text": " Yet I got to keep showing the fuck up every day and keep surfing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:54,760",
				"to": "00:16:57,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1014760,
				"to": 1017800
			},
			"text": " Keep going."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:16:57,800",
				"to": "00:17:13,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1017800,
				"to": 1033140
			},
			"text": " Thinking that someday I won't be invisible anymore."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:13,140",
				"to": "00:17:16,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1033140,
				"to": 1036360
			},
			"text": " It's really fucked up."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:16,360",
				"to": "00:17:23,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1036360,
				"to": 1043800
			},
			"text": " Because more than anything, I love the hermit quality to my life."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:23,800",
				"to": "00:17:26,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1043800,
				"to": 1046760
			},
			"text": " I love solitude."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:26,760",
				"to": "00:17:29,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1046760,
				"to": 1049540
			},
			"text": " I love being by myself."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:29,540",
				"to": "00:17:38,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1049540,
				"to": 1058280
			},
			"text": " I love just hanging out by myself inside my world, thinking about little projects and"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:38,280",
				"to": "00:17:42,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1058280,
				"to": 1062800
			},
			"text": " things that my mind likes to noodle on."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:42,800",
				"to": "00:17:53,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1062800,
				"to": 1073200
			},
			"text": " And now having gone through this experience, I've found a way to sit still and grow in"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:53,200",
				"to": "00:17:55,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1073200,
				"to": 1075480
			},
			"text": " ways I never thought possible."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:17:55,480",
				"to": "00:18:03,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1075480,
				"to": 1083560
			},
			"text": " And it's growing through stillness, which is an interesting paradigm in and of itself."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:03,560",
				"to": "00:18:06,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1083560,
				"to": 1086160
			},
			"text": " Standing still, yet you're growing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:06,160",
				"to": "00:18:12,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1086160,
				"to": 1092600
			},
			"text": " Maybe capitalism should take a he to that one."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:12,600",
				"to": "00:18:13,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1092600,
				"to": 1093600
			},
			"text": " That's the other thing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:13,600",
				"to": "00:18:15,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1093600,
				"to": 1095360
			},
			"text": " We can't have endless growth."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:15,360",
				"to": "00:18:19,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1095360,
				"to": 1099560
			},
			"text": " It's just universe doesn't fucking work that way."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:19,560",
				"to": "00:18:25,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1099560,
				"to": 1105200
			},
			"text": " And it's like the rich are fucking spending their money to make it be that way."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:25,200",
				"to": "00:18:26,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1105200,
				"to": 1106960
			},
			"text": " It's weird."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:26,960",
				"to": "00:18:31,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1106960,
				"to": 1111520
			},
			"text": " A lot of shit doesn't make any sense right now."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:31,520",
				"to": "00:18:35,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1111520,
				"to": 1115000
			},
			"text": " The economy doesn't make any sense."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:35,000",
				"to": "00:18:40,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1115000,
				"to": 1120480
			},
			"text": " The government doesn't make any sense."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:40,480",
				"to": "00:18:43,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1120480,
				"to": 1123280
			},
			"text": " Society and public is fucked up."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:43,280",
				"to": "00:18:46,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1123280,
				"to": 1126920
			},
			"text": " People are very isolated."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:46,920",
				"to": "00:18:49,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1126920,
				"to": 1129520
			},
			"text": " Way more than when I was a kid."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:49,520",
				"to": "00:18:51,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1129520,
				"to": 1131720
			},
			"text": " Holy shit."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:51,720",
				"to": "00:18:56,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1131720,
				"to": 1136480
			},
			"text": " And I thought people were kind of isolated when I was young."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:18:56,480",
				"to": "00:19:03,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1136480,
				"to": 1143840
			},
			"text": " But now people live in their own little fucking skull sized kingdoms and they don't venture"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:19:03,840",
				"to": "00:19:06,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1143840,
				"to": 1146320
			},
			"text": " outside very much."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:19:06,320",
				"to": "00:19:12,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1146320,
				"to": 1152280
			},
			"text": " And when they do and they're challenged, they get indignant, they accuse you for making"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:19:12,280",
				"to": "00:19:17,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1152280,
				"to": 1157600
			},
			"text": " them feel that way, which is totally bullshit."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:19:17,600",
				"to": "00:19:19,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1157600,
				"to": 1159600
			},
			"text": " I can say whatever the fuck I want."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:19:19,600",
				"to": "00:19:22,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1159600,
				"to": 1162800
			},
			"text": " If you get pissed off, that's your choice to get pissed off."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:19:22,800",
				"to": "00:19:28,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 1162800,
				"to": 1168700
			},
			"text": " You may not like that I'm telling you it's a fucking choice, but sit still."
